OL,3,GNEWSAAnglo Saxon 'sand body' among new
OL,4,ASutton Hoo finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mysterious "sand body" has been
OL,7,Funcovered during renewed excavations at
OL,8,FSutton Hoo.
OL,10,FThe site, near Woodbridge in Suffolk,
OL,11,Fis renowned for its royal burial ground
OL,12,Fand ship burials that have transformed
OL,13,Fhistorians' understanding of medieval
OL,14,FEngland.
OL,16,FNow, yet more mysteries have been
OL,17,Funcovered after the television
OL,18,Farchaeology series Time Team returned
OL,19,Ffor a special dig in 2025, which has
OL,20,Fnow been chronicled in a four-part
OL,21,Fdocumentary season.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
